---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

---
<figure class="fig11">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="Forty small squares in a row: thirty-nine grey ones that take 20 milliseconds each and one red one that takes 800 milliseconds. Below, the arithmetic: 10 slow calls in 400 requests is 2.5 percent, so the slowest one percent are all slow calls.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>One slow call in every 40, seen as the requests that make them</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cứ 40 lời gọi có một lời gọi chậm, nhìn qua các request chứa chúng</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="60" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="80" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="100" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="120" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="140" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="160" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="180" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="200" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="220" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="240" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="260" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="280" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="300" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="320" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="340" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="360" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="380" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="400" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="420" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="440" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="460" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="480" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="500" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="520" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="540" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="560" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="580" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="600" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="620" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="640" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="660" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="680" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="700" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="720" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="740" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="760" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="780" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="800" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="bar" />
    <rect x="820" y="64" width="16" height="36" class="rbar" />
    <text x="828" y="124" class="r" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>800 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>800 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="124" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>20 ms each</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mỗi cái 20 ms</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={70} y={190} size={26} />
    <text x="100" y="195" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>evidence-lab: 1 call in 40 is slow</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>evidence-lab: 40 lời gọi có 1 lời gọi chậm</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="244" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>400 requests contain 10 slow calls: 10 / 400 = 2.5 percent, more than the 1 percent that p99 looks at.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>400 request chứa 10 lời gọi chậm: 10 / 400 = 2,5 phần trăm, nhiều hơn 1 phần trăm mà p99 nhìn vào.</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="272" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>So the slowest 1 percent are all slow calls: p99 = 817 ms, while p95 = 69 ms.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nên 1 phần trăm chậm nhất toàn là lời gọi chậm: p99 = 817 ms, còn p95 chỉ 69 ms.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>No single request is unusual on its own. The tail is a rate: when slow calls are more than 1 in 100, p99 is a slow call.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Không request nào bất thường khi nhìn riêng lẻ. Cái đuôi là một tỉ lệ: khi lời gọi chậm nhiều hơn 1 trên 100, p99 chính là một lời gọi chậm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig11 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .fig11 .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .fig11 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .fig11 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .fig11 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .fig11 .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .fig11 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .fig11 .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .fig11 .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig11 .rbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .lead { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .fig11 .rline { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .fig11 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .rbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .fig11 .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .fig11 .arrow-l { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 .rarrow { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .rarrow-l { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
